## 12.6 ClawHub publish 实战 5 步

> **真名声明**：本节 5 步流程依据 docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/quickstart + docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/publishing + YouTube 官方教程（clawhub skill publish 完整演示）三方实拉确认。**clawhub 是独立 CLI**（不与 openclaw 同包），发布走 GitHub OAuth + OIDC。

```bash
# Step 1 · 安装 clawhub CLI（独立包）
npm i -g clawhub
# 或 pnpm add -g clawhub

# Step 2 · GitHub OAuth 登录（账号必须 ≥ 1 周，反 PAM spam）
clawhub login
clawhub whoami

# Step 3 · 本地 dry-run 预览元数据（不实际上传）
clawhub package publish ./silicon-life-training --family code-plugin --dry-run

# Step 4 · 正式 publish（含版本号、签名、source attribution、upload plan）
clawhub package publish ./silicon-life-training --family code-plugin

# Step 5 · 用户侧安装（走 openclaw plugins install + clawhub: 前缀）
openclaw plugins install clawhub:silicon-life-training --accept-capabilities
openclaw plugins enable silicon-life-training --accept-capabilities
openclaw plugins list --enabled | grep silicon-life-training
```

**关键约束（clawhub docs 原文）**：

| 约束 | 值 | 来源 |
|---|---|---|
| GitHub 账号年龄 | ≥ 1 周 | YouTube 教程："your GitHub account must be at least 1 week old before you can publish to claw hub this is an anti-PAM measure" |
| Family 标签 | `code-plugin` / `skill` / 其他 | docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/quickstart |
| Trusted publishing | `clawhub_token`（CI 长期）+ OIDC（无 token） | docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/publishing |
| Private 仓库 | 需 ClawHub GitHub App 授权（未来功能）| docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/publishing |
| `--environment <name>` | GitHub Actions environment claim 匹配 | docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/publishing |
| 撤回机制 | 违规 publish 可被下架；scan-held 仍可在 `/dashboard` 看到 | docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub |

### 12.6.1 GitHub Actions 自动发布（CI 用）

```yaml
# .github/workflows/silicon-life-publish.yml
name: Publish Silicon Life Training plugin
on:
  push:
    tags: ['v*']
jobs:
  publish:
    uses: openclaw/clawhub/.github/workflows/skill-publish.yml@main
    with:
      owner: bluesilicon
      dry_run: false
    secrets:
      clawhub_token: ${{ secrets.CLAWHUB_TOKEN }}
```

> **真名勘误**：旧 v1.0 调研报告把 ClawHub 误称为"OpenClaw plugin registry"——**ClawHub 是 CLI 工具名 + 服务名双用**，官方文档明确 `clawhub login / clawhub package publish` 这种命名空间隔离；OpenClaw 主仓不内置 registry 上传逻辑，registry 仅服务本机持久化（`plugins registry --refresh` 重建）。

